message: "Citation metadata for Mortal Computation via Multi-Scale Interoceptive Morphogenesis"
title: "Mortal Computation via Multi-Scale Interoceptive Morphogenesis"
type: software
abstract: >-
  A theoretical and numerical framework, MILLS (Multi-timescale Interoceptive Learning and Lifespan Selection),
  coupling variational inference, interoceptive homeostasis, parameter plasticity, and adaptive topology to a finite
  internal viability reserve. The release includes the full preprint and reproducible verification code.
